<title>INDIA: Indian Shipping -- Visakhapatnam Cargoes - Dec 16.</title>
<headline>Indian Shipping -- Visakhapatnam Cargoes - Dec 16.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
